Third-party components

Release builds bundle the following tools inside the application. They are
separate programs, invoked as subprocesses; none of their code is linked into
FormatForge itself.

  ffmpeg / ffprobe
      Licence: LGPL 2.1 or later, with optional GPL components depending on
               how the binary was configured. The builds used here are
               unmodified upstream releases from osxexperts.net and
               evermeet.cx.
      Source:  https://ffmpeg.org/

  7-Zip (via p7zip)
      Licence: LGPL 2.1 or later, with the unRAR restriction.
      Source:  https://github.com/jinfeihan57/p7zip

  libwebp (the cwebp command-line encoder)
      Licence: BSD 3-Clause.
      Source:  https://chromium.googlesource.com/webm/libwebp

Source builds do not include any of these; they use whatever the developer has
installed locally.
